              "explanation": "This phase focuses on testing the interface. The interface should be in such a way that it should be able to perform tasks correctly, and it should be able to handle a variety of tasks. It should achieve all the user's requirements.\nCommand Line Interface: The Command Line Interface provides a command prompt, where the user types the command and feeds it to the system. The user needs to remember the syntax of the command and its use.\nGraphical User Interface: Graphical User Interface provides a simple interactive interface to interact with the system. GUI can be a combination of both hardware and software. Using GUI, the user interprets the software."
